  "details": "I have recently gained the trusted user rank within vrchat due to my playtime and uploading an avatar. The issue is, I don't like the trusted label because I believe it leaves you open to harassment and gives people an impression that you play too much vrchat.\n\nI am aware that I can set my user rank to appear as just ‘User' but I would prefer appearing as a ’known user.' In my opinion, known user is a rank that shows people you are dedicated to the game and the friendships you build within it, but don't play so much vrchat that newer users would find you unapproachable.",
